# Programming Standards

## Context
- When writing any code

## Requirements
- Use consistent formatting (extremely detailed formatting rules taking dozens of lines)
- Follow naming conventions (dozens of lines on naming different constructs)
- Structure classes properly (detailed class structure rules)
- Implement error handling (extensive error handling guidelines)
- Manage performance (detailed performance optimization rules)
- Document code properly (detailed documentation standards)
- Write tests appropriately (detailed testing standards)

